* Equivalent-roughness ladder: what Manning does the [veg] module amount to?
* Meadow classes 2 and 3 at Manning 0.200; every other class at 0.023, which is
* the model's unifFrictCoef, so this reproduces the no-trachytope control
* exactly when the meadow value is also 0.023. Formula 53 is plain Manning and
* never touches rttfu, the term this build computes and discards.
* class  formula  n
  1    53    0.0230
  2    53    0.200
  3    53    0.200
  4    53    0.0230
  5    53    0.0230
